  "releaseNotes": "v1.0.6 - Param Defaults + Folder Components (January 2026)\n- NEW: Param default attribute - fallback when variable is null/empty\n- NEW: Folder-based components - block/projects → block/projects/default.html\n- Default values support interpolation syntax\n\nv1.0.5 - Pre-Render Data Extraction\n- ExtractIncludeNames() - Get cache keys before rendering\n- PrepareTemplate() + RenderPrepared() for maximum efficiency\n- IncludeNode.Name property for component identification\n\nv1.0.4 - Auto Cache Invalidation\n- Component files auto-reload on modification\n\nv1.0.3 - Dynamic Param Values\n- {{variable}} syntax in Param values\n\nv1.0.2 - Documentation Update\nv1.0.1 - Bug Fixes\nv1.0.0 - Initial Release",
